      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/J.%20Kent%20Masters\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">J. Kent Masters</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Masters has served as Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer of Albemarle since April 2020. He was previously a non-employee director of Albemarle from 2015 to 2020. Prior to joining Albemarle, he served as an Operating Partner of Advent International and as Chief Executive Officer of Foster Wheeler AG.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Neal%20Sheorey\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Neal Sheorey</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2023 November)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Sheorey has served as Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer since November 2023. Prior to joining Albemarle, he served as Vice President, Finance for Dow Inc.'s Coatings & Performance Monomers and Plastic Additives businesses.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kristin%20M.%20Coleman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kristin M. Coleman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2022 November)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Coleman has served as Executive Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary since November 2022. Prior to joining Albemarle, she served as Executive Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary of US Foods Holding Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Nneka%20Chiazor\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Nneka Chiazor</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2021 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Government Affairs</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Chiazor has served as Vice President, Government Affairs since 2021. Prior to joining Albemarle, she held leadership roles at Cox Communications and Verizon.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stacy%20S.%20Ruley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stacy S. Ruley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2021 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Chief Accounting Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Ruley has served as Vice President, Chief Accounting Officer since 2021. She joined Albemarle in 2015 and has held various finance leadership roles.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/J.%20Kent%20Masters\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">J. Kent Masters</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer of Albemarle Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ralf%20H.%20Cramer\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ralf H. Cramer</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Member of the Executive Board of Continental AG and President and CEO of Continental China.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Glenda%20J.%20Minor\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Glenda J. Minor</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2019 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chief Executive Officer and Principal of Silket Advisory Services. Former SVP and Controller of Evraz North America Limited.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jim%20O'Brien\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jim O'Brien</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2015 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Ashland Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Diarmuid%20B.%20O'Connell\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Diarmuid B. O'Connell</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Vice President of Business Development at Tesla, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dean%20L.%20Seavers\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dean L. Seavers</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former President and Executive Director of National Grid plc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gerald%20A.%20Steiner\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gerald A. Steiner</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2015 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President, Sustainability and Corporate Affairs of Monsanto Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Holly%20A.%20Van%20Deursen\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Holly A. Van Deursen</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Group Vice President, Petrochemicals of BP plc.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/915913/000091591324000045/alb-20240321.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">DEF 14A Proxy Statement</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-21)</span></li></ul>"
